+# Rigging
+
+## Stack
+
+- language: JavaScript
+- runner: cucumber-js
+- assertions: chai
+
+## Directories
+
+- implementation: js/
+- specs: specs/
+- verification: features/
+
+## Methods
+
+- verify: `npx cucumber-js specs/ --tags "not @captain and not @shipwright" --format progress`
+- prove: `npx cucumber-js "$SS_SCENARIO" --tags "not @captain and not @shipwright" --format progress`
+- sweep: `npx cucumber-js specs/ --tags "not @captain and not @shipwright" --format progress`
+- plank-join: none
+- hygiene: none
+- static: none
+- discovery: none
+- regression: none
+- condemnation: none
+- dead-code: none
+- spec-lint: none
+- install: none
+- ship: none
+- ship-verify: none
+
+## Perturbation
+
+- perturb: none
+
+## Dependencies
+
+- policy: locked
+
+## Tiers
+
+- sweep: `npx cucumber-js specs/ --tags "not @captain and not @shipwright" --format progress`
+
+## Outbound
+
+- none
